message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Do popular services open from Russia? Hourly open data"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "ProxysVPN"
    website: "https://proxysvpn.com"
abstract: >-
  Every hour the same set of public Globalping measurement points in Russia,
  mostly data-centre servers, opens the main page of popular services
  (YouTube, Telegram, WhatsApp, Instagram and others) over HTTPS without a VPN.
  One row per check and service. A separate file holds the same check made
  through ProxysVPN from Moscow. Published by ProxysVPN, a paid VPN service.
url: "https://proxysvpn.com/rabotaet-li"
